Show Values as the Chart Plots Them
You can show the progression of one or more values over time. To do so, click the tab Display and select
Plotter from the drop-down list Category.
To make the Chart collect data during the simulation run, select Collect Data in the dialog. To deactivate
data collection, clear the check box.
