Modeling the Assembly Line
Model the Assembly Line
Our AssemblyLine consists of an Interface/Entrance, four Conveyors, three Stations named Step1, Step2,
and Step3, and of an Interface/Exit.
We attached a Workplace each to each of the Stations. We also inserted an HtmlReport which we renamed
to ReportObject and our Comment named ToDo.
