Configure the Body Assembly
We model the CarBody section of our car assembly plant in a Frame, which we insert from the tab
MaterialFlow into the Frame MyCarAssembly.
• Convert the Glass-Box-Frame to a Black-Box-Frame as described under Model the Installation and
