We use the object Comment to quickly change to the Frame in which it is inserted, i.e., its location by
selecting Navigate > Open Location in its dialog.
The following instructions in the HtmlReport collect all objects of type Comment named ToDo in all
sub-Frames.
# ToDo
These tasks still have to be completed. 
